      "Thomas died in 1274, only forty-nine years old. The Church declared him a saint and a Doctor — the Angelic Doctor — and the patron of students everywhere.",
      "St Thomas Aquinas shows us that quiet thinkers can shake the world. The Dumb Ox bellowed after all — and his voice still echoes in every classroom where anyone wonders about God.",
